{"base_commit":"785731347fdf8356cd2fca9e7fd45b73193d1bc5","classification":"CONFIRMED_BUG","diagnostic_sha256":"779b7afd3e0c64071b1a9943d7b2e79347aa194c23aa39ba28cf8f797c205174","issue_id":"issue-ce0cf9748879a4f5af39e9c2be88f35d1684f32d0c2c60509721a373e053d528","non_claims":["No canonical source is changed.","No prior history-repair receipt is replayed or invalidated.","No mathematical proof or PX_RH_CLAIM is accepted."],"plan_pass1":{"converged":false,"findings":[{"explanation_ru":"Runtime передаёт в context и issue, и repair subject. Для repair transition selector обязан требовать repair_subject_id; для независимой classification — issue_id. Опираться только на заранее отфильтрованный context нельзя: при одинаковой evidence-паре это допускает чужое назначение того же actor/role.","finding":"Subject binding must be exact inside the shared selector.","id":"P1-SUBJECT-BINDING","required_plan_change":"Derive one effective subject from the transition, filter assignment.subject in the helper, and add the wrong-subject regression for both branches.","severity":"MEDIUM"},{"explanation_ru":"Если вызывать _validated_assignment_observation во время лексического обхода, старый launch-only row снова завершит проверку раньше точного result. Helper должен сначала собрать по точной паре locator+SHA256 ровно одно назначение, затем полностью валидировать только его; ноль, несколько или невалидное выбранное наблюдение должны завершаться ошибкой без fallback.","finding":"Evidence-pair selection must precede full observation validation and must fail closed on cardinality.","id":"P1-CARDINALITY-BEFORE-VALIDATION","required_plan_change":"Specify this order explicitly and retain regressions for insertion-order independence, ambiguous exact pairs, malformed/missing/duplicate selected observations, and negative repair artifacts.","severity":"MEDIUM"}],"mode":"A","next_requirement":"Revise the two-file plan to discharge both MEDIUM findings, then obtain two consecutive on-target clean or WORDING-only plan passes before implementation admission.","status":"FINDINGS"},"reason":"validate_issue_event_actor iterates actor-role assignments in lexical order and validates the first one before binding it to the exact RESULT locator-plus-SHA256 pair in event evidence. The current runtime context retains the earlier HISTORY_LIMIT_CLASSIFY_20260916 LAUNCH but filters its unrelated RESULT, while HISTORY_LIMIT_FIX_CHECK_20260916 retains the exact RESULT pair. The validator therefore rejects the current event with NATIVE_OBSERVATION_MISSING rather than validating the exact completed assignment. This blocks named typed acceptance; no false acceptance, data corruption, source installation, or mathematical result is established.","report_sha256":"ce0cf9748879a4f5af39e9c2be88f35d1684f32d0c2c60509721a373e053d528","reproduction":{"candidate_assignment_ids":["HISTORY_LIMIT_ACCEPT_REVIEW_20260916","HISTORY_LIMIT_CLASSIFY_20260916","HISTORY_LIMIT_FIX_CHECK_20260916","HISTORY_LIMIT_SOURCE_CHECK_20260916"],"evidence":[{"locator":"docs/session_protocols/team-evidence-db21cd5d7d372187aacd5d7126b05103cfbe667678da65182551756eedbed0a9.bin","sha256":"db21cd5d7d372187aacd5d7126b05103cfbe667678da65182551756eedbed0a9"}],"exact_result_assignment":"HISTORY_LIMIT_FIX_CHECK_20260916","result":"NATIVE_OBSERVATION_MISSING: HISTORY_LIMIT_CLASSIFY_20260916","shadow_assignment":"HISTORY_LIMIT_CLASSIFY_20260916"},"schema":"q3_assignment_selector_classification.v1","severity":"MEDIUM","sources":[{"path":"orchestrator/team_records.py","sha256":"2dfae6880df1e83b7722a9542cae4a6ff51c02d3f28f047255159c386f362a3a"},{"path":"orchestrator/tests/test_workflow_runtime.py","sha256":"7e3e2ffcff6ee77e3444955ec114492b4d74a57fdf4af467e6ab69efea82ca8a"}]}
